      CONTROL: magnitudes AND true directions      3363m     5.67x      1336m
      META-CHECK: the control must REPRODUCE RSSFIT (it is RSSFIT, rebuilt
      from magnitude+direction). 0.0 m apart -> PASS — the reconstruction is sound
      META-CHECK: do the three arms SEPARATE? spread 1621 m -> YES — error STRUCTURE matters, not only size
